Subject: [PATCH] Fix build/permissions, add Android TV remote support, harden
 ad blocker

- Manifest: fix permission names (android.permission.*), add LEANBACK_LAUNCHER,
  touchscreen/leanback uses-feature (not required), TV banner
- Build: optional debug/release signing, add Gradle wrapper, drop unused
  Firebase/Room/Retrofit/Moshi/OkHttp/KSP deps, minSdk 26, targetSdk 34,
  applicationId com.example.dizillaapp
- TV: virtual D-pad cursor, media keys, fullscreen seek/volume, TV mode and
  desktop/mobile UA settings (UA built from real WebView version), WebView
  version check, double-back to exit
- Ad blocker JS: debounce, narrower selectors, shallow overlay scan,
  iframe-aware media control bridge
- Cast: no repeated auto-cast, ignore blocked hosts, hide when unavailable
- Navigation: check blocklist before Google allowance
- Blocklist update: merge instead of overwrite, atomic write

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
